 ## Background
-Originated in the context of length-limited data transformation and compression [S1, unofficial]. The method is discussed in relation to Tunstall-Huffman approaches, noting similarities in the reasoning behind merging and extension processes [S1, unofficial]. The suboptimality of the greedy approach was proven by counterexample [S1, unofficial].
